==Battleground==
*The enemy base is protected by a [[Base Barrier]] until the boss is defeated.
*20 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 60~66.67 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,000f</sup>.
*1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>.
*1 [[Mysterious Calamity]] spawns as the boss after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns after 106.67 seconds<sup>3,200f</sup>.

